OL,3,GNEWSALeaseholders' fears over #45,000
OL,4,Aroof bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaseholders living in a group of flats
OL,7,Fin Sutton Coldfield say they are facing
OL,8,Fmounting anxiety after being told they
OL,9,Fcould be asked to contribute almost
OL,10,F#45,000 each towards major roof
OL,11,Freplacement works.
OL,13,FHousing association Bromford has
OL,14,Fwritten to leaseholders at blocks in
OL,15,FWoodfield Close and Bowlas Avenue in
OL,16,FFour Oaks, setting out estimated costs
OL,17,Ffor a scheme to replace existing flat
OL,18,Froofs with pitched roofs.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
