OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSALeaseholders' fears over #45,000
OL,4,Aroof bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents say they accept work is
OL,7,Fneeded but have been left shocked by
OL,8,Fthe scale of the projected bills, and
OL,9,Fare worried about what the costs could
OL,10,Fmean for their homes, finances and
OL,11,Ffuture plans.
OL,13,FChris Roe, who has lived on the estate
OL,14,Fsince 1981, said residents had known
OL,15,Fsubstantial works were being discussed,
OL,16,Fbut were stunned when the latest
OL,17,Ffigures arrived.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
